NAME
       more - show a text file one screen at a time

SYNOPSIS
       more [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
       more is the old, simple pager: it shows a screen of the file and waits.
       Space shows the next screen, Enter the next line, /WORD searches, q
       quits. less does everything more does and also scrolls back.

EXAMPLES
           more /etc/services
           ps aux | more

SEE ALSO
       less(1), head(1), tail(1), cat(1)
